  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 13.4% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $3.88B (13.4% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/11/06/solana-lset-for-its-first-tokenized-stock-venue-under-sec-framework-listing-galaxy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Solana set for its first tokenized stock venue under SEC framework, listing Galaxy</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQUG40X0oxMTlnbW1RVU12blpRN0N1SkJiM2FwNXd4cjVEZ3FmQnBTVlBzam5jUEh4R3Q0SF9Tc1F4RUVKajZKR2dteWZDa1ZnRVJBVC1TMXVNZWV6Zlo1VldyTHdEV25tZVJEN0NkQXZ0RUlvcjNXU1F5bGczNHVFQVFVVG1qaU5DaG94MWxGaVE5TUlXMGFaSTZtaVFFc09fU05XemRRdWJpbXZONVNVZTdnVElrZkI5Y0hldzlRd1ZOVW5mb3c?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NYSE taps Avalanche for tokenized stock settlement; AVAX price gains</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/11/10/emb-10-am-et-plume-affiliate-gets-the-legal-green-light-to-trade-regulated-security-entitlements-onchain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Plume affiliate lands broker-dealer license to bring real U.S. assets onchain</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takea